  "body": "It is a public discussion, public standard-body, ... Need some basic \"public disclaimer\" about **risk**. \r\n\r\n* W3C plans: `fullscreen` will become  a W3C recommendation?\r\n\r\n* `fullscreen`  is accepted in many browsers, so  we can say that `fullscreen`  is a [*de facto* standard](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/De_facto_standard)?\r\n\r\n... The Mozzila's [docs/Web/API/Fullscreen_API](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Fullscreen_API#Browser_compatibility) say that is *\"Deprecated. Not for use in new websites.\"*.\r\n",
